{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, this is a game I developed solo, and it's also my first developed game. Though it's quite simple, I hope you'll enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cute fantasy-themed ARPG looter game. All you need to do is grind, grind, and grind to collect a full set of equipment that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control the main character, deftly dodging enemy attacks, consuming food to recover health or enhance your abilities, and using normal attacks and charged attacks to defeat enemies. Gain experience, level up continuously, and allocate your attribute points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to obtain powerful equipment! The more challenging the map, the higher the chance of dropping advanced gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment comes with varying random rarities and numbers of attributes. Don\u2019t forget that you can reforge equipment attributes at the blacksmith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many equipment items also come with set bonuses\u2014wearing a full set will make you even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cute little cat might also hide some secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For potential buyers of this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Diablo-like games and looter enthusiasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who prefer to skip cutscenes, as there is barely any storyline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's mechanics are inspired by and pay tribute to <i>Shining Soul</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question feedback QQ group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >127552378</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Farm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/fa993b6c00384045d1b92709085fd62379448dbc.jpg"},{"name":"Uncommon Artifact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/f2b195713ef26fb5ff596a3fca584f0b204d9f37.jpg"},{"name":"Rare Artifact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/cbab94f0105b2203423ebf1a054ac47821c4e86b.jpg"},{"name":"Epic Artifact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/7fb98db5ac45d8a5ece30aa5716283a74e8f7eac.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Artifact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/fa76c751a03a3096039fc0a9878a0412b9f6006f.jpg"},{"name":"Forbidden Artifact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/d3af64b3562ae5ecb66a62a44cad73f5f433dca2.jpg"},{"name":"Armor Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/4529d761f7b509fee96394a762d9bbaddd39a9ac.jpg"},{"name":"Power of Legends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/8cbb8a0fc6e5ea9aee2089d6d62b6885853377e5.jpg"},{"name":"Forbidden Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/2b5b0886acc1d382b365e3f62ef5a01a99749276.jpg"},{"name":"Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4012470/d35bb36ca5a89f25585ba464ef6e6fe57f903dd7.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012470?t=1761569226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/76e1c00474ec5edae3608339556c53bba736aba3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761569226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/c190424cc2f8add99e9b3b017848a58c29793d1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761569226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/c190424cc2f8add99e9b3b017848a58c29793d1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761569226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, this is a game I developed solo, and it's also my first developed game. Though it's quite simple, I hope you'll enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cute fantasy-themed ARPG looter game. All you need to do is grind, grind, and grind to collect a full set of equipment that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control the main character, deftly dodging enemy attacks, consuming food to recover health or enhance your abilities, and using normal attacks and charged attacks to defeat enemies. Gain experience, level up continuously, and allocate your attribute points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strive to obtain powerful equipment! The more challenging the map, the higher the chance of dropping advanced gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment comes with varying random rarities and numbers of attributes. Don\u2019t forget that you can reforge equipment attributes at the blacksmith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many equipment items also come with set bonuses\u2014wearing a full set will make you even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cute little cat might also hide some secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For potential buyers of this game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Diablo-like games and looter enthusiasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who prefer to skip cutscenes, as there is barely any storyline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's mechanics are inspired by and pay tribute to <i>Shining Soul</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question feedback QQ group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >127552378</p>","developers":["PSP\u4e4b\u9b42"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/c99b02b22c605c66036f085c5e31634dc4a9705f/header.jpg?t=1761569226","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Tale of Dark Light","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u6697\u4e4b\u5149\u660e\u4f20 - $0.99 USD","packageid":1407915,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy Tale of Dark Light"}],"packages":[1407915],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 580 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st